{
  "id": 922,
  "description": "## All Australians Welcome! 🇦🇺\n\n### Core Guild Values\n\n- **Self-Enablement:** Every member is eligible for the Deputy role through consistent contributions, this grants you the rights to enjoy guild benefits and the responsibility manage recruitment and promotions.\n- **Welcoming:** We want a range of combat levels to join our guild as low level resource contributions are always appreciated. We expect you will grow with the guild and receive support whenever possible.\n  - If you choose to leave, you will always be welcomed back and at the same rank you were before.\n- **No Discord:** This is a Semi-Casual guild with no plans to go competitive. There are plenty of guilds with mandatory discord if you prefer that instead.\n\n\\_____________________________________________\n**📢 Announcement** 11 November \n\nSeason 13 Assault starts next Tuesday. Starting 2 Assaults have been published below.\n\nRemember to claim rewards from the Halloween Campaign page.\n\\_____________________________________________\n### Important Schedules\n\n**🕙 Raids Schedule (Subject To Supply)**\n- At this stage Deputies are free to schedule raids at times that suit them. We have a ridiculous amount of Marks to use up.\n- Daily every 18:00 PM for Lvl 70 and 20:00 PM for Lvl 40. \n\n**⚔️ Assault Schedule**\nOne assault every Sunday 12:00PM - 8:00PM.\n- Skyreach Peak 22 November\n- Floating Isles 29 November\n\n\n**🏊 Energising Pool**\n- Every SUNDAY in October 12:00PM to 3:00PM\n\n\\_____________________________________________\n\n### Hierarchy Progression\n\n**👑 Guild Leader Succession**\n\nIf a guild leader stops playing for a prolonged period, leadership will pass on to the most capable and willing deputy to continue our legacy.\n\n1. FabAsianZung (03/06/2025 - 31/08/2026)\n2. Drafiks (01/09/2026 - Current)\n3. N/A\n\n**🤴Promotion To Deputy**\n1. Consistent ingame activity. \n2. Consistent Guild Contributions (including deposits to stockpile), within 2 weeks of earning Officer rank. \n\n**👮‍♂️Promotion To Officer**\n1. Deputies are free to decide.\n2. Consistent Guild Contributions, within 2 weeks of earning Soldier rank. \n\n**🪖Promotion To Soldier**\n1. Deputies are free to decide, within 1 week of joining.\n2. Make an effort for guild contributions shortly after joining.\n\n**📃Accepting Recruit Applications**\n1. Combat level 40 or total level 500\n2. Ideally within Australia or a nearby region\n\n\\_____________________________________________\n### Miscellaneous Extras\n\n- Alts are welcome in the guild however they may be kicked to make space for a new Main, based on lowest activity &amp; contributions.\n- We run by **AEST** (GMT+10) 🌏\n- If kicked for inactivity, feel free to come back when you are ready \n- New Zealanders are also welcome 🇳🇿\n\n**🚩Guild Founded: 3rd of June 2025🚩**",
